umn\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a3d32f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4a3d32f6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-53fa2a01 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"53fa2a01\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5ba552ee\" data-id=\"5ba552ee\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-777845c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"777845c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>The International Conference on Software, Knowledge, Information Management and Applications (SKIMA 2023<\/strong>)\u00a0<span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #000000; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">is going to be held from 6-8 December in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. The conference aims to bring together researchers and experts in Knowledge Management, Software\u00a0 Engineering, and Information Systems to share their ideas, experiences, and insights. We welcome researchers and practitioners from academia,\u00a0 industries, research institutions, R&amp;D enterprise services and\u00a0 governmental organisations to exchange innovative contributions around the conference topics. This conference series was started in an\u00a0 international collaboration context between research professionals in\u00a0 Western and Asian countries in Chiang Mai, Thailand 2006. Subsequently,\u00a0 the next SKIMA conferences were organized in Kathmandu, Nepal in 2008;\u00a0 Fez, Morocco in 2009; Paro, Bhutan in 2010; Benevento, Italy in 2011, Chengdu, China in 2012, Chiang Mai Thailand in 2013, Dhaka, Bangladesh\u00a0 in 2014, Kathmandu Nepal in 2015, Chengdu China 2016, Colombo Sri\u00a0 Lanka in 2017, Phnom Penh, Cambodia in 2018, Maldives 2019 and Phnom\u00a0 Penh, Cambodia 2022. Digital Transformation of a higher education\u00a0 institutions will be one of the main focused areas of SKIMA 2023 in which\u00a0 a session for the head of higher education institutions will be arranged to\u00a0 share their knowledge, ideas, and views. The research topics of SKIMA\u00a0 2023 are very significant for developed and fast-growing region. The\u00a0 topics include but are not limited to: <\/span>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-276e5b6f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"276e5b6f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5dc06112\" data-id=\"5dc06112\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34a36601 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"34a36601\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\u00a0<\/div><h1 style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\"><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0em;\">Submission Guidelines<\/span><\/h1><div>Authors are invited to submit papers describing original,<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0em;\"><br \/><\/span><\/div><ul><li><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">Artificial Intelligence(AI)<\/span><\/li><li>Agile and Complex systems<\/li><li>AR\/VR\/Immersive Technology<\/li><li>Data Mining\/Engineering\/Sc.<\/li><li>Decision Support Systems<\/li><li>Business intelligence<\/li><li>Block Chain<\/li><li>Cloud computing<\/li><li>Cyber Security<\/li><li>Complex system management<\/li><li>Distribution Systems<\/li><li>Education Technology<\/li><li>E-&amp; Blended Learning<\/li><li>Enterprise interoperability<\/li><li>E-strategy \/ E-Business models<\/li><li>e-Tourism<\/li><li>Future Internets<\/li><li>Fuzzy, GA &amp; neural systems<\/li><li>Data Visualisation<\/li><li>Information System<\/li><li>Intelligent manufacturing systems<\/li><li>Medical\/Bioinformatics<\/li><li>eHealth\/mHealth\/Digital Health<\/li><li>Internet of things(IoTs)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-84e1617\" data-id=\"84e1617\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d2731f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1d2731f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Knowledge Management<\/li><li>Multi-agent systems<\/li><li>Knowledge based entrepreneurship<\/li><li>Mobile technology<\/li><li>Life-cycle engineering and PLM<\/li><li>Mechatronics of production management<\/li><li>Multi-objective optimization<\/li><li>Network management &amp; security<\/li><li>Ontology and mapping mechanisms<\/li><li>Representation techniques to semantic modelling<\/li><li>Future of digital life<\/li><li>Digital\/social media marketing<\/li><li>Immersive Technology &#8211; AR\/VR<\/li><li>Robotics and mechatronics<\/li><li>Sensor design, integration &amp; fusion<\/li><li>Service oriented architecture<\/li><li>Smart city\/village<\/li><li>Smart sensors networks<\/li><li>Smart home environments<\/li><li>Smart vision and image processing<\/li><li>Smart\/Precision Agriculture<\/li><li>Software engineering<\/li><li>Supply chains &amp; logistics management<\/li><li>System and Information Security<\/li><li>Wireless &amp; telecommunications<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-33cd7aa2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"33cd7aa2\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7babc2e1\" data-id=\"7babc2e1\" data-element_type=\"column